    <text type="letter">
        <body>
            <div type="writingSession">
                <pb n="1"/>
                <opener><salute>Dear <rs ref="#tillich_person_id__2872" type="person">Dr.
                            Glatzer</rs>:</salute>
                </opener>
                <p>Many thanks for sending me <rs ref="#tillich_person_id__306" type="person"
                        >Buber</rs>&apos;s new book which already has arrived and which I hope to be
                    able to read<lb/>very soon.<note type="ea">Es ist unklar, welches Buch hier
                        gemeint ist. Es könnte sich jedoch um: Martin Buber: Das Problem des
                        Menschen (1948) handeln.</note></p>
                <p>Of course I do remember you and I believe also to remember that once you have
                    visited me in my office. Beyond this I have read very interesting articles of
                    yours about medieval Arabic theology.</p>
                <p>I hope there will be an occasion to meet you again in <rs
                        ref="#tillich_place_id__319" type="place">New York</rs>,</p>
                <closer><salute>Cordially,</salute><signed><rs ref="#tillich_person_id__1928"
                            type="person">Prof. Paul Tillich</rs>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
